WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,780
Sister Wang, are you still leaving? I have packed everything.

2
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:15,120
It's like I'm sick.

3
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:18,920
It wasn't given to me last night. I didn't dare to sleep all night.

4
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:22,920
I'm thinking of making some steamed buns while I have gas to take with me on the road.

5
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:26,720
As a result, when I woke up early in the morning, the world was at peace.

6
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:27,980
so

7
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,220
Are you still leaving?

8
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:33,050
Let's go, just in time before everyone else leaves.

9
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:36,500
Let's go. I saw the news this morning.

10
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,500
What kind of living dead virus is loss?

11
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:43,300
Sister, the more I lose, the more I lose. I can guarantee that it is.

12
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,770
If you don't leave now, how long will you wait?

13
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:48,970
Aren’t you going back to the company today?

14
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:51,670
Then go back and pick up what you left behind

15
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,660
Let's go after we get it

16
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,460
There’s no need to go to work anyway

17
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:57,160
I just happened to go back to my hometown with my sister to play.
